: saffrinSubj: ...Cc: axlroseDate: Aug 13In simplest sense - I've had enough.This back and forth - one day you're talking to me, the next day you aren't,has aggrevated me.  I am tired of practically having to get anything out ofyou.  All last week you did not say a damn thing.  Two weekends ago there was NO sign of you - maybe you were on Patterns the whole time.  Came to Realms to answer my rant and then left.  Finals I figured out, but did yousay anything to me beforehand, or even during?  Not a damn thing... call meSaturday, nice as it was, but nothing, no plans, couldn't even answer myquestion about us in the future.  Saturday night, all day Sunday - nothinguntil you came on Sunday night drunk and yelled at me about something.  Thenyou were trying to be nice - back and forth.  Come Monday - nothing at all -maybe you were out looking for work, maybe you were out with the couple guysyou said were with you Saturday night..... so I logon here and idle, but doyou notice me?  Nope, sitting there talking away with Figleaf, Nae, Silas and~then~ you finally noticed me.  Me, the so-called important person in yourlife gets pushed aside again.Tonight, you logon and go straight to Silas it seems.  Give me some tells - Iguess I am not good enough to have your prescence eh?  Ran off with him too it seems, but so what at this point.  Should I go on?  The little shit - likehow you can run around marrying this person and that on muds galor, but onRealms, do we get married?  You're never around long enough to even ask.  Youdon't want people to know here so that's why you stay married.  The coming toRealms the one night to ask if you can marry off your test character was clas-sic!  You couldn't even stay around there long enough to talk to me.  Me!  Thelove of your life and all - no, push me aside.  I'll be around when ~you~ feellike it.  And sex - bah!  I have to beg and grovel dozens of times before youdecide you're up for it.  Or tell me about what you did on your own but notinclude me...So you want to know why I feel I don't need to talk to you anymore?  BecauseI am tired of playing second fiddle with you damnit!  - me...**saffrin**To: axlroseSubj: the fileDate: Aug 26I am making it detailed, my netcom kept crahsing, there are a few more names I needto get for you.Cindi**saffrin**To: axlroseSubj: thak youDate: Sep 16Thank you for defending me, you did help**axlrose**To: saffrinSubj: *shrug*Cc: axlroseDate: Sep 17I tried to be friendly, but nope, you do not want it.  No matter what I do, itis not good enough, that everything I say is against you.  I'm telling you thisCindi, you bitch to me how I twist and turn things around yet you do not eversee what you do.  And you have done it, don't play the innocent again.  Come onnow, how many times have I heard you over the phone complain about people likeFigleaf and Kryll, yet come here to the mud and everything is fine and dandy.It then makes me wonder what you say about me behind my back.  I told you afterour arguement that I will try to be the friend I was, but you put up barrierson everything.  I tried and tried and after so many times of feeling like you do not want to talk to me, I mention it to you in a last hope and what do youthen tell me?  \"Fuck you\" - geesh, to use your words, \"you have shown me a lotwith those words...\"I've tried to be nice, but this is not worth it.  If one line of mine can bringabout total hatred towards me, fine, I'll accept it.  But if you're so thin-skinned to not accept any apologizes, any attempts to make amends, then I don'twant to be a part of you carrying around guilt.  - Peter...**daniella**To: axlroseSubj: talkDate: Oct 31hey, whats up?  you said you kinda wanted to talk to me...i havent been on lately, and havent seen youwanna mail me about it?i have had so much shit to do, exam tomorrow, paper next thursdaytons of cleaning to do, etc etc etcmail me if 